Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): disable unsupported browser menu file commands

Expose unavailable Theme and Fixtures menu rows with their refusal reasons and accessible disabled states. Register menu bounds for disabled hover hit-testing. Pin browser and desktop behavior and correct stale release notes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1431
